{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:54:39+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-29T16:54:39+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Glanbia plc","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"Ireland","city":"Kilkenny","website":"https://www.glanbia.com","employees":4963,"summary":"Glanbia plc, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a nutrition company worldwide. The company offers sports nutrition and lifestyle nutrition products in various formats, such as powders, capsules, tablets, ready-to-eat bars, and ready-to-drink beverage. It also manufactures and sells cheese, dairy, and non-dairy nutritional and functional ingredients; and vitamin and mineral premixes products. In addition, the company engages in the financing business; property and land dealing business; property leasing; provision of business services and management solutions; and bioactive solutions. It offers its products under the Optimum Nutrition, BSN, Isopure, Nutramino, think!, Amazing Grass brands. The company sells its products through specialty retail, online, gym, and food, drug, mass, and club channels. Glanbia plc was founded in 1964 and is headquartered in Kilkenny, Ireland.","exchange":"Irish","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Glanbia plc, avec ses filiales, opère en tant que société de nutrition dans le monde entier. La société propose des produits de nutrition sportive et de nutrition lifestyle dans différents formats, tels que des poudres, des gélules, des comprimés, des barres prêtes-à-manger et des boissons prêtes-à-boire. Elle fabrique et vend également du fromage, des produits laitiers et des ingrédients nutritionnels et fonctionnels non laitiers, ainsi que des prémélanges vitaminiques et minéraux."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":4925667840,"shares_outstanding":241691264,"trailing_pe":24.554216,"forward_pe":13.477891,"price_to_book":2